 * {{Symbol|Attack Modifier}}
** Leech Seed is an active attack modifier, and has the following properties:
*** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|[[Cast Range|CastRange]] {{=}} Hero[[Attack Range|AtkRange]]}}
*** Affected by {{M|attack range}} sources of the same range-type as the caster.
** Both {{M|Autocast}} and an active cast uses Treant's current {{M|attack range}}.
*** Has Autocast off by default.
*** Unlike other active attack modifiers, it can proc while affected by {{M|silence}} sources, if set to {{M|Autocast}}.
** {{Symbol|Attack Damage|Instant}}
*** The ability component can be applied by [[instant attack]] sources.

* {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|treant_leech_seed}}
** Reapplying the debuff refreshes the duration.
** {{Symbol|Dispel|Death}}
*** The debuff applied persists [[death]], with all ability effects continue pulsing at the enemy unit's death location.
** The ability has two main components:
*** [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|1|21px]] {{Symbol|fx|v}} {{Symbol|bonus hprestore}}
**** The debuff-affected unit emits [[heal]] {{M|projectiles}} immediately upon debuff application, and heals Treant's allied units, prioritizing heroes, centered around the debuff-affected enemy unit, following the enemy as it moves.
**** Considers {{M|clones}} and {{M|illusions}} as 
**** The heal is sourced to Treant, and is defined as:
***** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|HealPulse {{=}} {{#var:Leech Seed type1 value5}} + Σ[[Attack Damage|AtkDmg]] × ({{#var:Leech Seed type1 value6}} + {{ValueColor||{{Show|T|Treant Protector|v2r}}|tal|x}})}}
**** Checks Treant's total {{M|attack damage}} value ([[before reductions]]) upon his {{M|attack point}}, and factors in the attack damage value as one heal instance.
**** {{Symbol|Invisible}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
***** If the debuff-affected enemy unit becomes [[invisible]], all ability effects continue pulsing from its current location.
**** {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}}
***** The heal projectiles neither searches for nor affects the following allied units:
****** {{M|Invulnerable}} units.
****** {{M|Hidden}} units.
***** However, projectiles traveling toward these units still heals them.
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|2|21px]] {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
**** Applies the following ability effects on the debuff-affected enemy unit:
****# The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} instance.
****# {{M|Bind}}
****#* {{M|Disarm}}
****#* {{M|Root}}
****#* {{M|True Sight}} over the debuff-affected enemy unit.
****# Treant's attack instance.

