fields.value:
 * Has the following targeting functionalities:
** {{Symbol|Target|Unit}}
*** When unit-targeted, applies {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|treant_living_armor}} to the affected allied unit.
*** Affects the following units:
**** {{M|Buildings}}
**** {{M|Couriers}}
**** {{M|Untargetable}} units.
**** {{M|Spell immune}} units.
*** Ignores the following units, but if the ability effects will continue to take effect if applied beforehand:
**** {{M|Hidden}} units.
**** {{M|Invulnerable}} units.
**** {{M|Ward-type units}}.
*** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
**** {{M|Doubletap}} casts the ability on Treant.
** {{Symbol|Target|Point}} or {{Symbol|Target|Ground}}
*** Checks for the allied unit's proximity ({{Code|d}}) to the point-targeted location, and applies {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|treant_living_armor}} to the nearest allied unit with the following priorities:
**** {{cf|expr}}
***** {{Code|d<sub>1</sub> {{=}} [[Wikipedia:Absolute value|{{!}}]] AlliedUnit Coordinates - PointTarget Coordinates [[Wikipedia:Absolute value|{{!}}]]}}
***** {{Code|d<sub>2</sub> {{=}} {{!}} AlliedBuilding Coordinates - PointTarget Coordinates {{!}}}}
***** {{Code|d<sub>1</sub> {{=}} d<sub>2</sub>}}
****** Procs either condition [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|2|21px]] or [[File:Dota2 Condition-3.png|3|21px]] correspondingly.
**** [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|1|21px]]
***** {{Code|d<sub>1</sub> < d<sub>2</sub>}}, applies the buff to the nearest {{M|allied hero|x}}.
****** Considers {{M|clones}}, {{M|illusions}}, and {{M|creep-heroes}} as heroes.
**** [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|2|21px]]
***** Else it applies to the nearest allied {{M|building}} or allied {{M|barracks}}.
**** [[File:Dota2 Condition-3.png|3|21px]]
***** Goes into {{M|cooldown}} and consumes {{M|mana}} if there are no valid allied units within the {{Symbol|Target|Ground}} ground-targeted location.
** {{Symbol|bonus t4l}} {{Symbol|Target|Area}}
*** {{cf|talnotes}}
**** The {{M|talent|t=t4l}} upgrade changes the ability targeting functionality from unit-targeted to {{ValueColor||area-targeted|25tal}}.
**** The ability now considers {{M|doubletap}} as a {{Symbol|Target|Ground}} ground-targeted cast, and centers the radius around Treant.

* {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|treant_living_armor}} has two main components:
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|1|21px]] {{Symbol|bonus hprestore}}
*** [[Heals]] affected allied units in 1-second intervals, 1 second after buff application, over {{#var:Living Armor value5}} instances.
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|2|21px]] {{Symbol|Damage Negation}}
*** The ability effects are applied as follows on the buff-affected unit:
***# When {{Code|DmgInst ≥ {{#var:Living Armor value2}} or Remainder}}, the damage instance applied does not interact with this [[damage negation]] source.
***# When {{Code|DmgInst ≤ {{#var:Living Armor value2}}}}, procs the damage negation component [[Damage Manipulation|after all reductions]].
***# The subsequent damage negation value ({{Code|N}}) is reduced by {{#var:Living Armor basic2}} ({{Code|r}}) per proc.
***# {{M|Dispels}} the buff once {{Code|N {{=}} 0}}.
*** Hence, the ability can negate up to {{calc|(v1*v2)-(v1*(v1-1)/2)*{{#var:Living Armor basic2}}|v1={{#var:Living Armor value1}}|v2={{#var:Living Armor basic1}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t3r}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|(v1*v2)-(v1*(v1-1)/2)*{{#var:Living Armor basic2}}|v1={{#var:Living Armor value1 tal}}|v2={{#var:Living Armor value3 tal}}}}|20tal}}) damage of all [[damage types]].

* {{cf|expr}}
** Number of Instances: {{Code|i {{=}} [[wikipedia:Floor and ceiling functions|⌈]] ({{#var:Living Armor basic1}} + {{ValueColor||{{Show|T|Treant Protector|v3r}}|tal|x}}) / ReductionValue [[wikipedia:Floor and ceiling functions|⌉]]}}
** {{Code|[[wikipedia:Triangular_number|T]] {{=}} i (i - 1) / 2}}
** Total damage block: {{Code|({{#var:Living Armor basic1}} + {{ValueColor||{{Show|T|Treant Protector|v3r}}|tal|x}}) - T × r}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Living Armor icon0}}
| desc = Infuses the target hero or structure with a protective coating which heals the target and blocks damage from player-controlled sources. Each time this spell blocks damage, the block amount is decreased. If the damage block is decreased to 0, the buff is removed early.
}}
* {{Symbol|bonus hprestore}}
** [[Heals]] up to {{calc|v1*{{#var:Living Armor value5}}|v1={{#var:Living Armor type1 value1}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t1r}} {{calc|v1*{{#var:Living Armor value5}}|v1={{#var:Living Armor type1 value1 tal}}}}) health over the entire duration.

